{"kind":"article","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}],"roleHeading":"API Collection","role":"collectionGroup","title":"Keyboard Shortcuts"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyboardShortcuts","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"How keyboard input flows through TUIkit: from raw terminal bytes to your view handlers.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Input-Types","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/QuitBehavior"],"title":"Input Types"},{"anchor":"Focus","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusState","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Focusable"],"title":"Focus"},{"anchor":"Status-Bar","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBar","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarItem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarItemProtocol","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Shortcut"],"title":"Status Bar"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/keyboardshortcuts"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"TUIkit uses a layered event dispatch system. When a key is pressed, it passes through up to five layers. The first layer that consumes the event wins: remaining layers are skipped. Layer 0 (text input) and Layer 3 (focus system) are mutually exclusive: when a text input element is focused, Layer 0 runs and Layer 3 is skipped.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"keyboard-event-dispatch.png","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Additionally, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Ctrl+C"},{"text":" (SIGINT) is handled at the OS signal level ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"before"}]},{"text":" any of these layers: it always terminates the application.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Available Keys","anchor":"Available-Keys"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"Key","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" enum defines all keys that TUIkit can recognize from terminal input:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Character Keys","anchor":"Character-Keys"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Any printable character is represented as ","type":"text"},{"code":".character(Character)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":[".onKeyPress(Key.from(\"x\")) {","    \/\/ handle \"x\" key","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Uppercase detection: when a capital letter is typed, the resulting "},{"code":"KeyEvent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" has "},{"code":"shift: true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" set automatically."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Special Keys","anchor":"Special-Keys"},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".escape"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Escape key"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".enter"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Enter \/ Return"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".tab"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tab"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".backspace"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Backspace \/ Delete backward"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".delete","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Forward delete","type":"text"}]}]]],"header":"row","type":"table"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Arrow Keys","anchor":"Arrow-Keys"},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Key","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".up"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow up"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".down"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow down"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".left"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow left","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".right"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow right","type":"text"}]}]]],"header":"row","type":"table"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Navigation Keys","anchor":"Navigation-Keys"},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".home"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Home"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".end","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"End","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".pageUp"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Page Up"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".pageDown"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Page Down"}]}]]],"header":"row","type":"table"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Key Events and Modifiers","anchor":"Key-Events-and-Modifiers"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeyEvent"},{"type":"text","text":" combines a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Key"},{"type":"text","text":" with modifier flags:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["public struct KeyEvent {","    public let key: Key","    public let ctrl: Bool     \/\/ Ctrl modifier","    public let alt: Bool      \/\/ Alt \/ Option modifier","    public let shift: Bool    \/\/ Shift modifier","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The terminal encodes modifiers differently from GUI frameworks:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ctrl+letter"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Detected from ASCII control codes (0x01–0x1A). For example, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Ctrl+C"},{"type":"text","text":" produces byte "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0x03"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Alt+key","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Detected from ESC prefix sequences (","type":"text"},{"code":"ESC","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" followed by the key byte).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shift"}]},{"text":": Only auto-detected for uppercase letters. The terminal does not send distinct shift codes for most keys.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Registering-Key-Handlers","text":"Registering Key Handlers","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".onKeyPress()"},{"type":"text","text":" modifier to handle keyboard events in your views:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Handle-All-Keys","text":"Handle All Keys","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["Text(\"Press any key\")","    .onKeyPress { event in","        if event.key == .enter {","            doSomething()","            return true   \/\/ consumed: stops propagation","        }","        return false      \/\/ not consumed: passes to next handler","    }"]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Handle-Specific-Keys","text":"Handle Specific Keys","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["Text(\"Use arrow keys\")","    .onKeyPress(keys: [.up, .down]) { event in","        if event.key == .up { moveUp() }","        else { moveDown() }","        return true","    }"]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Handle-a-Single-Key","text":"Handle a Single Key","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The single-key variant always consumes the event:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["Text(\"Press Enter to continue\")","    .onKeyPress(.enter) {","        continueAction()","    }"]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Handler-Priority","text":"Handler Priority","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Handlers are dispatched in "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"reverse registration order","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the deepest view in the tree (most recently registered) gets the event first. This means inner views can intercept events before outer views see them."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["VStack {","    Text(\"Outer\")","        .onKeyPress(.enter) {","            \/\/ Only reached if inner handler did NOT consume it","            print(\"outer enter\")","        }","    Text(\"Inner\")","        .onKeyPress(.enter) {","            \/\/ Gets the event FIRST","            print(\"inner enter\")","        }","}"]},{"name":"Important","style":"important","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"All key handlers are re-registered every render frame. If a view is not rendered (e.g. behind a conditional), its handlers are not active.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Focus-Navigation","text":"Focus Navigation","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"FocusManager","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" dispatches key events in three steps:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Focused element delegation"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the focused element’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"handleKeyEvent(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is called first. If it consumes the event, dispatch stops."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tab \/ Shift+Tab"}]},{"type":"text","text":": cycles focus between elements (wraps around)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow key fallback","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Up\/Left move to the previous element in the section, Down\/Right move to the next. This only triggers if the focused element did not consume the arrow key in step 1."}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Key","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Action"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Tab","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move focus to the next focusable element (wraps around)"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Shift+Tab","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Move focus to the previous focusable element (wraps around)","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Up \/ Left","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move to previous element in section (fallback)"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Down \/ Right"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move to next element in section (fallback)"}]}]]]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For more details, see "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Default-Bindings","text":"Default Bindings","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Layer 4 provides three built-in key bindings that work without any configuration:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Action","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Condition"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Q"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Quit application","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only when "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/QuitBehavior","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" allows it"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"t"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"T"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cycle to next color theme"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Only when theme cycling is enabled","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"a"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"A"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cycle to next appearance"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Always active"}]}]]]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Quit-Behavior","text":"Quit Behavior","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/QuitBehavior","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" enum controls when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"type":"text","text":" is allowed to quit:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Value"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Behavior"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".always"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"text":" quits from any screen (default)","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".rootOnly"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"type":"text","text":" only quits when no status bar context is pushed"}]}]]]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".rootOnly"},{"type":"text","text":" is useful for modal dialogs: push a status bar context for the dialog, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"type":"text","text":" will be blocked until the user dismisses it:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["Dialog(title: \"Confirm\") {","    Text(\"Are you sure?\")","} footer: {","    ButtonRow {","        Button(\"Yes\") { confirm() }","        Button(\"No\") { cancel() }","    }","}",".statusBarItems(context: \"confirm-dialog\") {","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"y\", label: \"yes\")","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"n\", label: \"no\")","}"]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Changing-the-built-in-quit-key","text":"Changing the built-in quit key","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default quit binding is configurable through "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarState\/quitShortcut","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["@Environment(\\.statusBar) private var statusBar","","statusBar.quitShortcut = .escape","statusBar.quitShortcut = .ctrlQ","statusBar.quitShortcut = QuitShortcut(","    key: .f12,","    shortcutSymbol: Shortcut.f12,","    label: \"exit\"",")"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This changes both the Layer 4 quit binding and the displayed system item."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Overriding-q-in-a-local-view-context","text":"Overriding `q` in a local view context","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A user-defined status bar item with shortcut ","type":"text"},{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and an action intercepts the key before the default quit binding runs:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["EditorView()","    .statusBarItems {","        StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"q\", label: \"close\") {","            dismissEditor()","        }","    }"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This is the correct way to repurpose ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"text":" for a specific screen, dialog, or focus section. The matching user item handles the event in Layer 1, so Layer 4’s built-in quit binding is never reached.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Status-Bar-Shortcuts","text":"Status Bar Shortcuts","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The status bar displays available shortcuts to the user. Use the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Shortcut"},{"type":"text","text":" namespace for consistent, platform-standard symbols:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Display-Symbols","text":"Display Symbols","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":[".statusBarItems {","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.arrowsUpDown, label: \"nav\")","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.enter, label: \"select\", key: .enter)","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.escape, label: \"back\")","}"]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Common-Symbols","text":"Common Symbols","type":"heading"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Symbol","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Constant"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"⎋","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.escape","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Escape"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↵"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.enter","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Enter"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⇥"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.tab","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tab"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"⇤","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.shiftTab"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Shift+Tab","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⌫"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.backspace"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Backspace"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⌦"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.delete"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Delete"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"␣"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.space"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Space","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"↑","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.arrowUp","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow up"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↓"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.arrowDown","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow down","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"←","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.arrowLeft"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow left"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"→"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.arrowRight"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow right"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"↑↓","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.arrowsUpDown"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Vertical arrows"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"←→"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.arrowsLeftRight"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Horizontal arrows","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↑↓←→"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.arrowsAll"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All arrows"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⌃"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.control"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Control modifier"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"⇧","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.shift"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Shift modifier","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"⌥","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.option","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Option \/ Alt"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Shortcut-Helpers","text":"Shortcut Helpers","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Combine modifier + key: \"⌃c\"","Shortcut.combine(.control, \"c\")","","\/\/ Ctrl+key display: \"^c\"","Shortcut.ctrl(\"c\")","","\/\/ Range display: \"1-9\"","Shortcut.range(\"1\", \"9\")"]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Common-Shortcut-Letters","text":"Common Shortcut Letters","type":"heading"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Constant","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Value"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.quit"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.yes","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"y","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.no","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"n","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.cancel","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"c"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.ok","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"o"}]}]]]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Automatic-Key-Matching","text":"Automatic Key Matching","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarItem","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" automatically derives the trigger key from the shortcut string when no explicit ","type":"text"},{"code":"key:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" parameter is given:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Symbol shortcuts (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⎋"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↵"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⇥"},{"text":") map to their corresponding ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Key"},{"text":" values","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Single-character shortcuts (","type":"text"},{"code":"\"q\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"y\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") map to ","type":"text"},{"code":".character(thatChar)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow combinations ("},{"code":"\"↑↓\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") match "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"both"}]},{"type":"text","text":" individual arrow keys"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Multi-character non-symbol strings are informational only (no trigger key)"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Automatic: shortcut \"q\" triggers on Key.character(\"q\")","StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"q\", label: \"quit\") { quit() }","","\/\/ Explicit: override the trigger key","StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.enter, label: \"select\", key: .enter) { select() }","","\/\/ Informational: no action, no trigger","StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.arrowsUpDown, label: \"nav\")"]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Status-Bar-Context-Stack","text":"Status Bar Context Stack","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The status bar supports a context stack for temporary shortcut overrides: useful for modals and nested navigation:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Set global items",".statusBarItems {","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.arrowsUpDown, label: \"nav\")","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.enter, label: \"select\", key: .enter)","}","","\/\/ Push context-specific items (e.g. for a dialog)",".statusBarItems(context: \"my-dialog\") {","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"y\", label: \"yes\") { confirm() }","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"n\", label: \"no\") { cancel() }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When a context is pushed, its items replace the global items in the display. System items (quit, theme, appearance) remain visible unless a user item uses the same shortcut string.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"System-Items","text":"System Items","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Three system items are shown by default:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shortcut"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Label"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Order","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"quit","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"900","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Quit the application","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"a"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"appearance"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"910","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cycle border appearance"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"t","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"theme"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"920","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cycle color theme"}]}]]]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"System items appear on the right side of the status bar. They can be disabled individually:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ In your App","statusBar.showSystemItems = false       \/\/ Hide all system items","statusBar.showThemeItem = false         \/\/ Hide only theme cycling","statusBar.showAppearanceItem = false    \/\/ Hide only appearance cycling"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When all system items are hidden and there are no active user items, the status bar is hidden completely."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StateManagement","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ThemingGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppearanceAndColors","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Preferences","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/CustomViews","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PaletteReference","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ListAndTable","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/LayoutSystem"],"title":"Guides","generated":true}],"references":{"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/StatusBarItem":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarItem","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"StatusBarItem"}],"url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/statusbaritem","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A status bar item displaying a shortcut and its description."}],"title":"Stat